                                                    },
                                                    {
                                                        "_id": "61e58abe",
                                                        "tab_title": "Do I need to bring anything?",
                                                        "tab_content": "<p>Bring a notebook and, for the hands-on sessions, a laptop with the tools you already use. No specialist setup is required for this demo program.</p>",
